  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "1655-root",
    "title": "Prestigious award for Dr Gilani",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "Professor Anwar Gilani has been honoured with the Pride of Performance Award.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "85fa1cd2ef1950aa",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "1655-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/1655-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Prestigious award for Dr Gilani"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Professor Anwar Gilani has been honoured with the Pride of Performance Award by the president of Pakistan. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Dr Gilani joined AKU in 1986 as a senior instructor and rose to become a professor of pharmacology in 1997. He has a wide range of research interests and has made breakthrough discoveries in the area of natural products pharmacology. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "While commenting on the motivations for his research, Dr Gilani said: \"There is a need to explore our indigenous resources and to develop a system where traditional and modern physicians can work together for better healthcare of non-affording patients, who comprise the majority of our country's population.\""
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
